<title>AUSTRALIA: Southcorp to raise A$25 mln in div plan.</title>
<headline>Southcorp to raise A$25 mln in div plan.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Appliance manufacturer and vintner Southcorp Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had arranged the underwritten placement of 6.2 million shares to raise A$25.48 million as part of its dividend reinvestment plan.</p>
<p>The shares were being placed under the same terms and conditions applicable to shareholders under the dividend reinvestment plan, the company said.</p>
<p>Southcorp last month announced a dividend of 8.25 cents per share for the six months to December 31.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
